stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ASSIGNED : mission created with its agents
    ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : colony.submitMission() accepted - environment, capability, availability, equipment and resource checks all passed (resources consumed, agents reserved)
    ASSIGNED --> FAILED : submission rejected - another mission is active, agent unsuitable or unavailable, missing equipment or target, insufficient resources, dust storm (exploration), communication disruption (rescue)
    IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : advanceTime() [elapsed < required]
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advanceTime() [elapsed >= required] / release agents
    IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : dust storm (rover missions), battery depleted, equipment failure, communication lost (rescue) / release agents
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    note right of ASSIGNED
        A rejected mission goes straight to FAILED.
        It is never registered as the colony active mission.
    end note
    note right of FAILED
        Failed missions are never retried.
        A new Mission must be created for another attempt.
    end note
